flowchart TB
  settings[用户模型配置 models.json<br/>受保护凭据文件] --> config[ModelConfigStore 与 Model Catalog]
  config --> snapshot[Run 固定 ModelProfileSnapshot<br/>本地 ID、远端 ID、能力、预算]
  snapshot --> gateway[ModelGateway 与 Model Lease]
  gateway --> factory[Pydantic AI Provider Factory<br/>共享 RuntimeAsyncKernel]
  factory --> route{wire_api}
  route -->|chat_completions| chat[PydanticAIModelClient<br/>OpenAIChatModel 与 Function Tool]
  route -->|openai_responses| responses[OpenAIResponsesModelClient<br/>官方 OpenAI SDK 原生适配]
  chat --> remote[DeepSeek / Kimi / MiniMax<br/>Volcengine / 自定义地址]
  responses --> remote
  remote --> normalized[统一响应、用量、错误与回放记录]
  normalized --> sampling[SamplingRuntime<br/>完整校验后进入 Eidos Loop]
  discover[设置页主动自定义模型发现] -.仅请求模型列表.-> remote
